    <id>https://community.sap.com/t5/artificial-intelligence-blogs-posts/august-developer-challenge-now-closed/bc-p/14479048#M2394</id>
    <title>Re: August Developer Challenge - NOW CLOSED</title>
    <updated>2026-09-03T14:20:47.126000+02:00</updated>
    <author>
      <name>Dan_Wroblewski</name>
      <uri>https://community.sap.com/t5/user/viewprofilepage/user-id/72</uri>
    </author>
    <content>&lt;P&gt;First, I want to make it clear that I will not verify any more issues regarding who completed all the tasks, for anyone else. We gave badges to over 500 people, with very liberal requirements, so I think most everyone should be satisfied. And even if you did not get a badge, it is only a badge.&lt;/P&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;a href="https://community.sap.com/t5/user/viewprofilepage/user-id/16032"&gt;@deiamolina&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;We required that the source field be filled with "vercel", which is was for 131 of the 144 entries. All the rest were "other" except for 1 that was "n8n". If we did something wrong about how we counted, I apologize. But no worries. You have your badge, and thanks for participating.&lt;/P&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;a href="https://community.sap.com/t5/user/viewprofilepage/user-id/148298"&gt;@shrinivasan_neelamegam&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;Anything to add?&lt;/P&gt;</content>
    <link href="https://community.sap.com/t5/artificial-intelligence-blogs-posts/august-developer-challenge-now-closed/bc-p/14479048#M2394"/>
    <published>2026-09-03T14:20:47.126000+02:00</published>
  </entry>
