    <content>&lt;P&gt;The badge should say Joule Studio, which includes (or is expected to include) all the tools in the challenge.&lt;/P&gt;&lt;P&gt;P.S.: It is important to distinguish between Joule, which essentially is a chatbot, and Joule Studio, which is used to build skills/agents up until now, and is expected to soon be used to build apps, workflows and agents.&lt;/P&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;span class="lia-inline-image-display-wrapper lia-image-align-inline" image-alt="Dan_Wroblewski_0-1788499506351.png" style="width: 684px;"&gt;&lt;img src="https://community.sap.com/t5/image/serverpage/image-id/455458i8A3C5C8A5E2A6351/image-dimensions/684x192/is-moderation-mode/true?v=v2" width="684" height="192" role="button" title="Dan_Wroblewski_0-1788499506351.png" alt="Dan_Wroblewski_0-1788499506351.png" /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;P&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;P&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;</content>
    <link href="https://community.sap.com/t5/artificial-intelligence-blogs-posts/august-developer-challenge-now-closed/bc-p/14479431#M2403"/>
    <published>2026-09-04T07:22:36.814000+02:00</published>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>https://community.sap.com/t5/devtoberfest/build-your-reputation-community-stars-tell-how-they-built-their-brand/ev-p/14480288</id>
    <title>Build Your Reputation: Community Stars Tell How They Built Their Brand</title>
    <updated>2026-09-06T13:32:39.255000+02:00</updated>
    <author>
      <name>Dan_Wroblewski</name>
      <uri>https://community.sap.com/t5/user/viewprofilepage/user-id/72</uri>
    </author>
    <content>&lt;P&gt;Beyond mastering your craft, building a solid reputation is the most effective way to unlock new opportunities, relationships, and career growth.&lt;/P&gt;&lt;P&gt;In this interactive session, successful community members share their personal journeys: why reputation mattered to them, how they got started, and everyday actions that expanded their reach. Join us to learn practical strategies for growing your network and making your work visible worldwide.&lt;/P&gt;&lt;P&gt;SPEAKERS:&lt;/P&gt;&lt;UL&gt;&lt;LI&gt;&lt;SPAN class=""&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Patrizia Rossi,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;Starion&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&lt;LI&gt;&lt;SPAN class=""&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Mustafa Bensan&lt;/STRONG&gt;, &lt;SPAN&gt;Autonify&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&lt;LI&gt;&lt;SPAN class=""&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Luiz Carlos de Souza,&lt;/STRONG&gt; &lt;SPAN&gt;SAP Community Curator Curitiba / Brazil&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&lt;LI&gt;&lt;SPAN class=""&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Josh Bentley &lt;/STRONG&gt;(host), SAP&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&lt;/UL&gt;</content>
    <link href="https://community.sap.com/t5/devtoberfest/build-your-reputation-community-stars-tell-how-they-built-their-brand/ev-p/14480288"/>
    <published>2026-09-06T13:32:39.255000+02:00</published>
  </entry>
  <entry>
