    <content>&lt;P&gt;&lt;a href="https://community.sap.com/t5/user/viewprofilepage/user-id/14731"&gt;@FabienHenique&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;I have tried to get clarity, and though I have gotten some response, I still do not have a clear positioning statement about SBPA, n8n, Integration Suite, and I do not want to say anything that someone could misconstrue. I'm sorry, but I hope there will be clarify at SAP TechEd.&lt;/P&gt;&lt;P&gt;Please attend our Devtoberfest sessions on Joule Studio and n8n to ask that question &lt;span class="lia-unicode-emoji" title=":slightly_smiling_face:"&gt;🙂&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/P&gt;</content>
