  <entry>
    <id>https://community.sap.com/t5/devtoberfest-blog-posts/complete-devtoberfest-warm-up-puzzle-and-explore-quot-my-completions-quot/ba-p/14482638</id>
    <title>Complete Devtoberfest Warm-Up Puzzle – and Explore "My Completions"</title>
    <updated>2026-09-10T06:17:06.490000+02:00</updated>
    <author>
      <name>Dan_Wroblewski</name>
      <uri>https://community.sap.com/t5/user/viewprofilepage/user-id/72</uri>
    </author>
    <content>&lt;P&gt;We've created a small, 5-by-5 warm-up crossword puzzle, with clues about SAP and more, so you can get ready for the Devtoberfest fun activities and get acquainted with the "My Completions" area.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;P&gt;First, complete the puzzle, located at&amp;nbsp;&lt;A href="https://developers.sap.com/puzzles/devtoberfest-2026-warmup" target="_self" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;https://developers.sap.com/puzzles/devtoberfest-2026-warmup&lt;/A&gt;.&lt;/P&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;span class="lia-inline-image-display-wrapper lia-image-align-inline" image-alt="2026-09-10_06-36-44.png" style="width: 999px;"&gt;&lt;img src="https://community.sap.com/t5/image/serverpage/image-id/457232i7AD8B60B569A00FF/image-size/large/is-moderation-mode/true?v=v2&amp;amp;px=999" role="button" title="2026-09-10_06-36-44.png" alt="2026-09-10_06-36-44.png" /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;P&gt;Once you fill it in, click &lt;STRONG&gt;Check&lt;/STRONG&gt;.&lt;/P&gt;&lt;UL&gt;&lt;LI&gt;Yes, you can take that picture and put it into chatGPT and get all the answers, but where's the fun?&lt;/LI&gt;&lt;/UL&gt;&lt;P&gt;If all goes well, you'll get a fun surprise. Then click &lt;STRONG&gt;Submit&lt;/STRONG&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;span class="lia-inline-image-display-wrapper lia-image-align-inline" image-alt="Dan_Wroblewski_0-1789013403019.png" style="width: 211px;"&gt;&lt;img src="https://community.sap.com/t5/image/serverpage/image-id/457233i30E78B1939BCF8C8/image-dimensions/211x269/is-moderation-mode/true?v=v2" width="211" height="269" role="button" title="Dan_Wroblewski_0-1789013403019.png" alt="Dan_Wroblewski_0-1789013403019.png" /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;P&gt;Then go to &lt;STRONG&gt;My Completions&lt;/STRONG&gt;.&lt;/P&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;span class="lia-inline-image-display-wrapper lia-image-align-inline" image-alt="Dan_Wroblewski_1-1789013579177.png" style="width: 1038px;"&gt;&lt;img src="https://community.sap.com/t5/image/serverpage/image-id/457234i1A73ECF311B35150/image-dimensions/1038x372/is-moderation-mode/true?v=v2" width="1038" height="372" role="button" title="Dan_Wroblewski_1-1789013579177.png" alt="Dan_Wroblewski_1-1789013579177.png" /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;P&gt;And you should see the puzzle completed.&lt;/P&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;span class="lia-inline-image-display-wrapper lia-image-align-inline" image-alt="Dan_Wroblewski_2-1789013681964.png" style="width: 1010px;"&gt;&lt;img src="https://community.sap.com/t5/image/serverpage/image-id/457235iDD01C7A8A98E590E/image-dimensions/1010x530/is-moderation-mode/true?v=v2" width="1010" height="530" role="button" title="Dan_Wroblewski_2-1789013681964.png" alt="Dan_Wroblewski_2-1789013681964.png" /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;P&gt;You will also see all the tutorials you completed or started from the &lt;A href="https://developers.sap.com/tutorial-navigator/" target="_self" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Tutorial Navigator&lt;/A&gt;, and when you start your Devtoberfest adventure, you will see all the activities you completed (and points you earned).&lt;/P&gt;&lt;P&gt;And if you haven't registered (free) for the event, do so here:&amp;nbsp;&lt;A href="https://developers.sap.com/devtoberfest/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;https://developers.sap.com/devtoberfest/&lt;/A&gt;&amp;nbsp;(you must log in first)&lt;/P&gt;&lt;P&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;P&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;P&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;P&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;</content>
    <link href="https://community.sap.com/t5/devtoberfest-blog-posts/complete-devtoberfest-warm-up-puzzle-and-explore-quot-my-completions-quot/ba-p/14482638"/>
    <published>2026-09-10T06:17:06.490000+02:00</published>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>https://community.sap.com/t5/devtoberfest-blog-posts/the-scavenger-hunt-for-devtoberfest-2026/bc-p/14482639#M1149</id>
    <title>Re: Scavenger Hunt - Devtoberfest 2026 (COMING SOON)</title>
    <updated>2026-09-10T06:22:01.160000+02:00</updated>
    <author>
      <name>Dan_Wroblewski</name>
      <uri>https://community.sap.com/t5/user/viewprofilepage/user-id/72</uri>
    </author>
    <content>&lt;P&gt;In the meantime, try out our Devtoberfest Warm-Up Puzzle:&amp;nbsp;&lt;A href="https://community.sap.com/t5/devtoberfest-blog-posts/complete-devtoberfest-warm-up-puzzle-and-explore-quot-my-completions-quot/ba-p/14482638" target="_blank"&gt;https://community.sap.com/t5/devtoberfest-blog-posts/complete-devtoberfest-warm-up-puzzle-and-explore-quot-my-completions-quot/ba-p/14482638&lt;/A&gt;&lt;/P&gt;</content>
