    <published>2026-09-10T06:22:01.160000+02:00</published>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>https://community.sap.com/t5/devtoberfest/how-have-sap-customers-adopted-n8n/ev-p/14484286</id>
    <title>How Have SAP Customers Adopted n8n</title>
    <updated>2026-09-13T21:21:02.372000+02:00</updated>
    <author>
      <name>Dan_Wroblewski</name>
      <uri>https://community.sap.com/t5/user/viewprofilepage/user-id/72</uri>
    </author>
    <content>&lt;P&gt;From the mouth of an n8n Elite Partner and former SAP Developer Hero, learn how customers have used n8n in their landscapes (before its embedding in Joule Studio). Discover the strong points of n8n, and its limits – which processes have held up in production and which ones did not. And understand the processes customers ask for the most: ones that gets the SAP flow into tools their teams work in every day, like Slack, HubSpot, and Jira. The session includes live demos of workflows against a real SAP system.&lt;/P&gt;&lt;P&gt;SPEAKER:&lt;/P&gt;&lt;UL&gt;&lt;LI&gt;Sascha Seegebarth, Avanai&lt;/LI&gt;&lt;/UL&gt;</content>
    <link href="https://community.sap.com/t5/devtoberfest/how-have-sap-customers-adopted-n8n/ev-p/14484286"/>
    <published>2026-09-13T21:21:02.372000+02:00</published>
  </entry>
