    <id>https://community.sap.com/t5/devtoberfest/n8n-from-the-ground-up/ev-p/14491429</id>
    <title>n8n from the Ground Up</title>
    <updated>2026-09-24T15:44:47.859000+02:00</updated>
    <author>
      <name>Dan_Wroblewski</name>
      <uri>https://community.sap.com/t5/user/viewprofilepage/user-id/72</uri>
    </author>
    <content>&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;Hear directly from Oli Morris, from the n8n developer relations team, to really understand how n8n works under the hood, including how data flows and gets transformed throughout a workflow. Also learn the kinds of automation teams build with it, especially in a large enterprise, how developers move from testing to production, and what's special with the n8n enterprise edition. Also get tips on how to manage data running through your workflows and how to manage errors. And finally, see how agents have been incorporated into workflows.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;SPEAKERS:&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;UL&gt;&lt;LI&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;Oli Morris, n8n&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&lt;/UL&gt;</content>
    <link href="https://community.sap.com/t5/devtoberfest/n8n-from-the-ground-up/ev-p/14491429"/>
    <published>2026-09-24T15:44:47.859000+02:00</published>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>https://community.sap.com/t5/devtoberfest-blog-posts/what-would-devtoberfest-be-without-its-games/ba-p/14491882</id>
    <title>What would Devtoberfest be without its games?</title>
    <updated>2026-09-25T08:40:41.541000+02:00</updated>
    <author>
      <name>Dan_Wroblewski</name>
      <uri>https://community.sap.com/t5/user/viewprofilepage/user-id/72</uri>
    </author>
    <content>&lt;P&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Week 2 of Devtoberfest&lt;/STRONG&gt; brings a set of &lt;span class="lia-unicode-emoji" title=":balloon:"&gt;🎈&lt;/span&gt;🧩&lt;STRONG&gt;diversions and puzzles&lt;/STRONG&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class="lia-unicode-emoji" title=":mushroom:"&gt;🍄&lt;/span&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;span class="lia-unicode-emoji" title=":alien_monster:"&gt;👾&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt; for you, including the traditional &lt;STRONG&gt;SAP&amp;nbsp;Cryptic Crossword&lt;/STRONG&gt;.&lt;/P&gt;&lt;P&gt;We have adapted some common puzzles to make them "enterprise-ready", with clues about SAP products (yes, including that new product everyone is talking about), AI, data protocols, Java's old UI platform, networking, JavaScript functions and much more. In the crossword, we even mention at least 3 different Developer Advocates 👱🏻‍&lt;span class="lia-unicode-emoji" title=":woman:"&gt;👩🏻&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lia-unicode-emoji" title=":girl:"&gt;👧&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/P&gt;&lt;P&gt;You can see all the &lt;STRONG&gt;fun activities&lt;/STRONG&gt; here, and all the instructions will be in the puzzle or in the related tutorials:&amp;nbsp;&lt;A href="https://developers.sap.com/devtoberfest/schedule/?type=activity&amp;amp;track=%F0%9F%9F%A1+Fun+%26+Activities&amp;amp;row=activity%3A3c0a9302-56bf-47fd-81b3-f77e6d77207a" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;https://developers.sap.com/devtoberfest/schedule/?type=activity&amp;amp;track=%F0%9F%9F%A1+Fun+%26+Activities&amp;amp;row=activity%3A3c0a9302-56bf-47fd-81b3-f77e6d77207a&lt;/A&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;P&gt;All together, nearly &lt;STRONG&gt;5,000&lt;/STRONG&gt; points.&lt;/P&gt;&lt;P&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;H1 id="toc-hId-1695509450"&gt;Cryptic Crossword&lt;/H1&gt;&lt;P&gt;Access the puzzle here:&amp;nbsp;&lt;A href="https://developers.sap.com/devtoberfest/schedule/?type=activity&amp;amp;track=%F0%9F%9F%A1+Fun+%26+Activities&amp;amp;row=activity%3Ad7bd49da-1b1f-455b-b87b-47448f7c2949" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;https://developers.sap.com/devtoberfest/schedule/?type=activity&amp;amp;track=%F0%9F%9F%A1+Fun+%26+Activities&amp;amp;row=activity%3Ad7bd49da-1b1f-455b-b87b-47448f7c2949&lt;/A&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;P&gt;What's great this year is that you do the puzzle in our new Developer Center – no copying grids or entering clues one by one in an awkward tutorial layout. And you can check your answers at any time, and when you get it all right, you'll get a little visual surprise and a lot of points.&lt;/P&gt;&lt;P&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;span class="lia-inline-image-display-wrapper lia-image-align-inline" image-alt="Dan_Wroblewski_0-1790316089761.png" style="width: 858px;"&gt;&lt;img src="https://community.sap.com/t5/image/serverpage/image-id/462365i7795AABD1C0A3EB5/image-dimensions/858x442/is-moderation-mode/true?v=v2" width="858" height="442" role="button" title="Dan_Wroblewski_0-1790316089761.png" alt="Dan_Wroblewski_0-1790316089761.png" /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;P&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;H1 id="toc-hId-1498995945"&gt;SAP Equation&lt;/H1&gt;&lt;P&gt;Access the puzzle here:&amp;nbsp;&lt;A href="https://developers.sap.com/devtoberfest/schedule/?type=activity&amp;amp;track=%F0%9F%9F%A1+Fun+%26+Activities&amp;amp;row=activity%3Afcc8c0bd-87e1-4917-8176-a5fb14f9d776" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;https://developers.sap.com/devtoberfest/schedule/?type=activity&amp;amp;track=%F0%9F%9F%A1+Fun+%26+Activities&amp;amp;row=activity%3Afcc8c0bd-87e1-4917-8176-a5fb14f9d776&lt;/A&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;P&gt;Similar to the scavenger hunt, except that you are searching for numbers and you do not have search throughout the internet. You'll end up with a number, that is actually quite relevant to Devtoberfest.&lt;/P&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;span class="lia-inline-image-display-wrapper lia-image-align-inline" image-alt="Dan_Wroblewski_1-1790316321515.png" style="width: 748px;"&gt;&lt;img src="https://community.sap.com/t5/image/serverpage/image-id/462366i661DC57AE26F2B84/image-dimensions/748x573/is-moderation-mode/true?v=v2" width="748" height="573" role="button" title="Dan_Wroblewski_1-1790316321515.png" alt="Dan_Wroblewski_1-1790316321515.png" /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;P&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;H1 id="toc-hId-1302482440"&gt;Paint By Numbers&lt;/H1&gt;&lt;P&gt;Access the puzzle here:&amp;nbsp;&lt;A href="https://developers.sap.com/devtoberfest/schedule/?type=activity&amp;amp;track=%F0%9F%9F%A1+Fun+%26+Activities&amp;amp;row=activity%3A10a51c55-b381-45d1-b073-a6c8a6cb542a" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;https://developers.sap.com/devtoberfest/schedule/?type=activity&amp;amp;track=%F0%9F%9F%A1+Fun+%26+Activities&amp;amp;row=activity%3A10a51c55-b381-45d1-b073-a6c8a6cb542a&lt;/A&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;P&gt;This puzzle is one my daughter enjoys a lot, since she is a graphic artist. Fill in the grid according to the rules in the tutorial, and you get a picture.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;span class="lia-inline-image-display-wrapper lia-image-align-inline" image-alt="Dan_Wroblewski_2-1790316475673.png" style="width: 954px;"&gt;&lt;img src="https://community.sap.com/t5/image/serverpage/image-id/462368i152FF76BF98A9877/image-dimensions/954x452/is-moderation-mode/true?v=v2" width="954" height="452" role="button" title="Dan_Wroblewski_2-1790316475673.png" alt="Dan_Wroblewski_2-1790316475673.png" /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;P&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;H1 id="toc-hId-1105968935"&gt;Quote Boxes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/H1&gt;&lt;P&gt;Access the puzzle here:&amp;nbsp;&lt;A href="https://developers.sap.com/devtoberfest/schedule/?type=activity&amp;amp;track=%F0%9F%9F%A1+Fun+%26+Activities&amp;amp;row=activity%3A3c0a9302-56bf-47fd-81b3-f77e6d77207a" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;https://developers.sap.com/devtoberfest/schedule/?type=activity&amp;amp;track=%F0%9F%9F%A1+Fun+%26+Activities&amp;amp;row=activity%3A3c0a9302-56bf-47fd-81b3-f77e6d77207a&lt;/A&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;P&gt;In these 2 puzzles, you are given all the letters to a pair of quotations about SAP software, said by 2 of our top executives.&lt;/P&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;span class="lia-inline-image-display-wrapper lia-image-align-inline" image-alt="Dan_Wroblewski_0-1790318276834.png" style="width: 1256px;"&gt;&lt;img src="https://community.sap.com/t5/image/serverpage/image-id/462384iCA64CF9AB4B6AF90/image-dimensions/1256x901/is-moderation-mode/true?v=v2" width="1256" height="901" role="button" title="Dan_Wroblewski_0-1790318276834.png" alt="Dan_Wroblewski_0-1790318276834.png" /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;P&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;P&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;P&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;</content>
    <link href="https://community.sap.com/t5/devtoberfest-blog-posts/what-would-devtoberfest-be-without-its-games/ba-p/14491882"/>
    <published>2026-09-25T08:40:41.541000+02:00</published>
  </entry>
  <entry>
