    <content>&lt;P&gt;We got feedback that &lt;STRONG&gt;Clue 7&lt;/STRONG&gt; was difficult to find and they needed some help.&lt;/P&gt;&lt;P&gt;Please notice the intro. I have highlighted the key clues:&lt;/P&gt;&lt;UL&gt;&lt;LI&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;One of our Developer Advocates is quite &lt;STRONG&gt;blue&lt;/STRONG&gt; because they're &lt;STRONG&gt;parked&lt;/STRONG&gt; inside the SAP TechEd website for the &lt;STRONG&gt;Berlin show&lt;/STRONG&gt;, trying to help so many &lt;STRONG&gt;attendees with information&lt;/STRONG&gt; about the event.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&lt;/UL&gt;&lt;P&gt;The link already takes you to the Berlin TechEd site. Probably worth exploring and learning more.&lt;/P&gt;</content>
