  <entry>
    <id>https://community.sap.com/t5/devtoberfest-blog-posts/share-a-pic-of-your-pet-for-devtoberfest/ba-p/14494961</id>
    <title>Share a Pic of Your Pet for Devtoberfest🦉😸🙊🦝🐯🐩🦓🐮🐷🐗🐫🦣🐭🦛🐰🐓🐔🦘🐥🦆🦅🦜🦚</title>
    <updated>2026-10-01T08:15:33.816000+02:00</updated>
    <author>
      <name>Dan_Wroblewski</name>
      <uri>https://community.sap.com/t5/user/viewprofilepage/user-id/72</uri>
    </author>
    <content>&lt;P&gt;Announcing 🦜🦛&lt;STRONG&gt;Petoberfest&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;span class="lia-unicode-emoji" title=":rabbit_face:"&gt;🐰&lt;/span&gt;🦘, your chance to show off your pet, or your pet rock, or your chia pet, or&amp;nbsp;your stuffed animal companion.&lt;/P&gt;&lt;P&gt;We have a new &lt;A href="https://developers.sap.com/petoberfest/petoberfest-2026/" target="_self" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Petoberfest tool&lt;/A&gt; in the Developer Center for uploading your Petoberfest pics:&lt;/P&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;span class="lia-inline-image-display-wrapper lia-image-align-inline" image-alt="Dan_Wroblewski_1-1790777731221.png" style="width: 760px;"&gt;&lt;img src="https://community.sap.com/t5/image/serverpage/image-id/464002iBD4CCBDDB4F28552/image-dimensions/760x342/is-moderation-mode/true?v=v2" width="760" height="342" role="button" title="Dan_Wroblewski_1-1790777731221.png" alt="Dan_Wroblewski_1-1790777731221.png" /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;P&gt;Just &lt;A href="https://developers.sap.com/petoberfest/petoberfest-2026/" target="_self" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;upload a picture of your pet&lt;/A&gt;, perhaps dressed up in SAP gear:&lt;/P&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;span class="lia-inline-image-display-wrapper lia-image-align-inline" image-alt="IMG_1160.jpg" style="width: 535px;"&gt;&lt;img src="https://community.sap.com/t5/image/serverpage/image-id/463979iA37334DC73482C7E/image-dimensions/535x518/is-moderation-mode/true?v=v2" width="535" height="518" role="button" title="IMG_1160.jpg" alt="IMG_1160.jpg" /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;P&gt;Or generate a cool AI represnetation of your pet, perhaps traveling to space:&lt;/P&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;span class="lia-inline-image-display-wrapper lia-image-align-inline" image-alt="Gemini_Generated_Image_d8j95qd8j95qd8j9.jpg" style="width: 697px;"&gt;&lt;img src="https://community.sap.com/t5/image/serverpage/image-id/463981i827961DF6A5FEC5C/image-dimensions/697x674/is-moderation-mode/true?v=v2" width="697" height="674" role="button" title="Gemini_Generated_Image_d8j95qd8j95qd8j9.jpg" alt="Gemini_Generated_Image_d8j95qd8j95qd8j9.jpg" /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;P&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;H2 id="toc-hId-1824682440"&gt;World Animal Day/Week&lt;/H2&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;span class="lia-inline-image-display-wrapper lia-image-align-inline" image-alt="Dan_Wroblewski_0-1790776754381.png" style="width: 269px;"&gt;&lt;img src="https://community.sap.com/t5/image/serverpage/image-id/463970iC7A94C79D814501A/image-dimensions/269x180/is-moderation-mode/true?v=v2" width="269" height="180" role="button" title="Dan_Wroblewski_0-1790776754381.png" alt="Dan_Wroblewski_0-1790776754381.png" /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;P&gt;We scheduled Petoberfest to come out during &lt;A href="https://www.worldanimalday.org/" target="_self" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer"&gt;World Animal Day&lt;/A&gt; (Oct. 4) and World Animal Week to support the efforts to protect animals all over the world.&lt;/P&gt;&lt;P&gt;For uploading a picture (all pictures are moderated and must be accepted), you will earn 600 points.&lt;/P&gt;&lt;P&gt;If you upload a picture of yourself helping with an animal project – at an animal shelter or feeding the local horses – you will get bonus kudos and cuddles from us &lt;span class="lia-unicode-emoji" title=":cat_face_with_wry_smile:"&gt;😼&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/P&gt;&lt;P&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;</content>
    <link href="https://community.sap.com/t5/devtoberfest-blog-posts/share-a-pic-of-your-pet-for-devtoberfest/ba-p/14494961"/>
    <published>2026-10-01T08:15:33.816000+02:00</published>
  </entry>
